Subject: [PATCH 05/37] ARM: dts: r8a7790: Correct critical CPU temperature
Date: Fri, 22 Dec 2017 11:29:43 +0100
Message-Id: <fcab5651fae4258a993170b7aaf443adbd3d4d84.1513938145.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
